-- GAME ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  Title       Bruce Lee
  Publisher   U.S. Gold, 1985
  Version     1.0

-- YOU NEED ------------------------------------------------------------------
  Your own copy of the original game, saved beside this patch:

  File        Bruce Lee (1985)(U.S. Gold).z80
  MD5         6e088cc665d1cdbcd32effa061ad6e8e

  The patch carries none of the game's code. It only works with that exact
  dump, under that name or any other: anything else is refused, with a
  message naming the file it wants.

-- WHAT IT DOES --------------------------------------------------------------
  Moving figures become Next hardware sprites, so they keep their own colours
  and no longer take on the scenery's (colour clash). Game logic is unchanged.

  Colours     Default (the game's own) plus: Enhanced, chosen on the menu, off
              by default.
  Enhanced    Approved figure and room colours. Optional, off by default.
              Native editable sprite and scenery sheets. Source: Enhanced
              colours: Armando Quaranta (Spec256).

  Pace        original

  Note        Original figures with colour clash removed by default; optional
              approved Enhanced figures and all 20 room tiles. Original
              loading screen. Fits a 1MB Next. Known issues: asynchronous
              input and idle/interrupt refresh timing can change some random
              trajectories despite exact hook-local R. Individual beeper
              intervals differ by up to 2.572us in the measured scenes.
              Missing: natural completion, later-room/two-player playthrough,
              hardware and other-emulator testing.

-- MENU ----------------------------------------------------------------------
   1  Infinite lives
   2  No walking sound
   3  Faster movement
   4  No enemies

  Archive POK translated to this exact 48K release. Infinite lives, walking
  sound off, faster movement, no enemies. All off by default.

